{"seq":1,"slug":"evt-finance-risk","title":"金融风险 VaR/ES","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/practice/evt-finance-risk","wordCount":1434,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"金融风险-var-es\">金融风险 VaR/ES</h1><p>银行风控部门每天都要回答一个问题：在最糟糕的少数交易日里，我们的投资组合会亏多少？经典做法是假设收益服从正态分布，可 1987 年黑色星期一的 -22%、2020 年 3 月的连续熔断早已证明，金融收益的尾巴远比正态厚。极值理论恰好为这个尾巴而生——它不假设整条收益分布，只用超阈值损失拟合广义帕累托分布，给出比经验分布更稳定、比正态更诚实的尾部风险度量。本篇讲清 VaR 与 ES 的定义、EVT 如何估它们、Basel III FRTB 的监管转向，以及 EVT 与波动率模型的互补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-var-与-es-两个尾部风险度量\">核心概念：VaR 与 ES 两个尾部风险度量</h2><p><strong>风险价值</strong>（Value at Risk, VaR）是给定置信水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 下的损失分位数：未来一段时间内，损失超过 VaR 的概率只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>。形式上，若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为损失，</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>VaR</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>inf</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{VaR}_\\alpha = \\inf\\{l : P(L &gt; l) \\le 1 - \\alpha\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">in<span style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">f</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如 99% 日 VaR 是&quot;百日里最糟那一日&quot;的损失水平。VaR 直观、易沟通，却有两个致命缺陷：它<strong>不告诉你一旦突破会亏多少</strong>（尾部内部信息全丢），且它<strong>不满足次可加性</strong>——两个组合合并后的 VaR 可能大于各自之和，违背&quot;分散降险&quot;的常识，因而不是&quot;一致风险度量&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>期望损失</strong>（Expected Shortfall, ES，也叫 CVaR）修复了这两点。它是超过 VaR 的那些损失的条件期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ES</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mtext>VaR</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ES}_\\alpha = \\mathbb{E}[L \\mid L &gt; \\text{VaR}_\\alpha]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ES</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>ES 平均了整条尾部，捕捉&quot;突破之后有多惨&quot;，且满足次可加性，是数学上一致的风险度量。这正是为什么监管把权重压向了 ES。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度量</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>尾部内部信息</th>\n<th>次可加性/一致性</th>\n<th>监管地位（2026）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VaR</td>\n<td>损失分位数</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>仍用于回测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ES</td>\n<td>超 VaR 损失的均值</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>FRTB 内模主度量（97.5%）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"evt-如何估-var-与-es\">EVT 如何估 VaR 与 ES</h2><p>直接用历史模拟（经验分位数）估 99% 以上的极端分位数有个硬伤：尾部观测太少，经验分位数跳跃且无法外推到样本外的更极端水平。EVT 用 <a href=\"../models/pot-gpd\">POT 与广义帕累托</a> 的 GPD 给尾部一个平滑的参数模型，从而稳定外推。</p>\n<p>设阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>、超阈值概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0738em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、GPD 参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\xi, \\tilde\\sigma)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则高置信水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 的 VaR 由 <a href=\"../estimation/return-levels\">回归水平与重现期</a> 同一套反算逻辑给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>VaR</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>ξ</mi></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ξ</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{VaR}_\\alpha = u + \\frac{\\tilde\\sigma}{\\xi}\\left[\\left(\\frac{1-\\alpha}{\\zeta_u}\\right)^{-\\xi} - 1\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3449em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0738em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.689em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>ES 在 GPD 下有极简的闭式（当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ES</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>VaR</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ξ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ξ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ES}_\\alpha = \\frac{\\text{VaR}_\\alpha}{1-\\xi} + \\frac{\\tilde\\sigma - \\xi u}{1-\\xi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ES</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大（尾越重），ES/VaR 的比值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ξ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{1-\\xi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3262em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大——重尾资产一旦突破 VaR，平均损失会远超 VaR 本身。这把<a href=\"../estimation/tail-index-estimation\">尾指数估计</a>的精度直接绑定到资本充足率上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"basel-iii-frtb-的监管转向\">Basel III FRTB 的监管转向</h2><p>2008 危机暴露了 VaR 框架在尾部的盲视，巴塞尔委员会的回应是&quot;交易账簿根本性审查&quot;（Fundamental Review of the Trading Book, FRTB）。其核心变化是把内部模型法的主风险度量从 <strong>99% VaR 切换到 97.5% 期望损失（ES）</strong>，理由正是 ES 的尾部敏感性与一致性。FRTB 还引入了流动性分层（不同风险因子用不同持有期）与压力期校准。</p>\n<p>据巴塞尔委员会与行业测算，FRTB 落地后市场风险资本要求大幅抬升——对 Group 1 大型银行加权平均增幅约 63%，全球系统重要性银行（G-SIB）子集约 69%。这个量级解释了为什么尾部建模从学术练习变成了直接影响资本成本的工程问题。EVT 在这个框架下的价值，是为 97.5% ES 提供比正态或经验分布更可靠的尾部外推。截至 2026 年，前沿研究甚至开始尝试用大语言模型做 VaR/ES 的提示式估计，但 GPD 仍是监管认可的主力工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与波动率模型互补-条件-evt\">与波动率模型互补：条件 EVT</h2><p>纯 EVT 有个理论硬伤：它假设损失独立同分布，而金融收益有明显的<strong>波动率聚簇</strong>——平静期和动荡期交替，违反了 GPD 的独立性前提（这正是<a href=\"evt-pitfalls\">极值分析陷阱</a>的头号问题在金融的体现）。McNeil 与 Frey 提出的<strong>条件 EVT</strong>（两步法）化解了这点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[金融收益序列&lt;br/&gt;有波动率聚簇] --&gt; B[第一步: GARCH&lt;br/&gt;拟合并提取标准化残差]&#10;  B --&gt; C[标准化残差&lt;br/&gt;近似 iid]&#10;  C --&gt; D[第二步: 对残差尾部&lt;br/&gt;用 POT/GPD 建模]&#10;  D --&gt; E[残差的极端分位数]&#10;  E --&gt; F[乘回当日条件波动率]&#10;  F --&gt; G[条件 VaR/ES&lt;br/&gt;随市场动荡自适应]\">flowchart TD\n  A[金融收益序列&lt;br/&gt;有波动率聚簇] --&gt; B[第一步: GARCH&lt;br/&gt;拟合并提取标准化残差]\n  B --&gt; C[标准化残差&lt;br/&gt;近似 iid]\n  C --&gt; D[第二步: 对残差尾部&lt;br/&gt;用 POT/GPD 建模]\n  D --&gt; E[残差的极端分位数]\n  E --&gt; F[乘回当日条件波动率]\n  F --&gt; G[条件 VaR/ES&lt;br/&gt;随市场动荡自适应]</pre><p>先用 GARCH 类模型过滤掉波动率聚簇得到近似独立的标准化残差，再对残差尾部用 EVT，最后乘回当日的条件波动率预测。这样得到的 VaR/ES 会随市场状态动态收紧或放松，既尊重了 EVT 的尾部理论，又尊重了金融时间序列的依赖结构。波动率本身的演化属于<a href=\"../../stochastic-processes/applications/finance-engineering\">随机过程</a>的范畴，本篇只在接口层引用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>VaR 是损失分位数，直观但丢失尾部内部信息且不满足次可加性；ES 是超 VaR 损失的均值，捕捉尾部且一致。</li>\n<li>EVT 用 GPD 给尾部平滑参数模型，稳定外推极端分位数，VaR/ES 有闭式，ES/VaR 比值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ξ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{1-\\xi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3262em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随尾重增大。</li>\n<li>Basel III FRTB 把内模主度量从 99% VaR 切换到 97.5% ES，资本要求大幅抬升（大行约 +63%），使尾部建模成为资本工程。</li>\n<li>纯 EVT 违反金融收益的独立性假设，条件 EVT（GARCH 滤波 + 残差 POT）化解波动率聚簇，给出自适应的条件 VaR/ES。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>方法来源：<a href=\"../models/pot-gpd\">POT 与广义帕累托</a>、<a href=\"../estimation/return-levels\">回归水平与重现期</a>、<a href=\"../estimation/tail-index-estimation\">尾指数估计</a>；金融数据的依赖陷阱：<a href=\"evt-pitfalls\">极值分析陷阱</a>。</li>\n<li>波动率与金融随机建模：<a href=\"../../stochastic-processes/applications/finance-engineering\">随机过程的金融与工程应用</a>。</li>\n<li>风险度量的分布基础，见<a href=\"../../probability-statistics/random-variables/continuous-distributions\">连续型分布</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"金融风险 VaR/ES","id":"金融风险-var-es"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：VaR 与 ES 两个尾部风险度量","id":"核心概念-var-与-es-两个尾部风险度量"},{"level":2,"text":"EVT 如何估 VaR 与 ES","id":"evt-如何估-var-与-es"},{"level":2,"text":"Basel III FRTB 的监管转向","id":"basel-iii-frtb-的监管转向"},{"level":2,"text":"与波动率模型互补：条件 EVT","id":"与波动率模型互补-条件-evt"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"极值不确定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/estimation/evt-uncertainty"},"next":{"title":"水文与气候","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/extreme-value-theory/practice/evt-hydrology-climate"}}